<h1 style="color:#062AAE; font-size:22pt; border-bottom:2px solid #062AAE; padding-bottom:6px; margin-top:28px;">MySect Platform — Comprehensive Presentation &amp; Feature Walkthrough</h1>

<strong>Author:</strong> MySect Product &amp; Engineering Team  
<strong>Date:</strong> October 2026  
<strong>Document Purpose:</strong> Presentation Guide &amp; Plain-English Feature Reference  

<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0; margin:24px 0;"/>

<h2 style="color:#0F172A; font-size:16pt; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:22px;">1. Executive Summary: What is MySect?</h2>

<strong>MySect</strong> is an integrated corporate secretarial management platform designed for the Malaysian business ecosystem.

Historically, communication between business owners (Company Directors) and licensed Company Secretaries has been scattered across WhatsApp messages, untracked emails, and paper documents. This causes missed statutory filing deadlines, penalties from the Companies Commission of Malaysia (SSM), and compliance confusion.

MySect solves this by uniting three distinct user groups under one interconnected digital platform:
1. <strong>The Client (Mobile App):</strong> Business owners and directors who want easy, hassle-free compliance.
2. <strong>The Secretary (Web Workspace):</strong> Licensed company secretaries who need an organized desk to review documents and file with SSM.
3. <strong>The Admin (HQ Console):</strong> Platform operators who oversee firms, assign companies, and guarantee system security.

<pre style="background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #E2E8F0; padding:12px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9pt; line-height:1.4;">
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
