<h2 style="color:#0F172A; font-size:16pt; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:22px;">2. Platform 1: The Client Mobile App (<code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">mobile_app</code>)</h2>
<em>Target User:</em> <strong>SME Business Owners, Managing Directors, and Authorized Company Representatives.</strong>  
<em>Primary Goal:</em> Remove the mystery of company compliance and allow directors to know their statutory standing in under 5 seconds.

