dding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">[2. COMPLIANCE CALENDAR]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Interactive monthly calendar showing statutory milestones</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Section 68 Annual Return lodgement dates</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Section 248 Audited Financial Statements due date</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• CP204 Tax estimate reminder milestones</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">[3. DOCUMENT VAULT / REPOSITORY]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Categorized Folders: Accounting, Corporate, Statutory</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• "Attention Needed" folder for flagged files</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Built-in file viewer &amp; direct upload button</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">[4. STATUTORY FILING TRACKER]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Step-by-step submission wizard</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Live Progress Pill: "Waiting for Sec" -&gt; "Approved" -&gt; "SSM"</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">[5. PROFILE &amp; SECRETARY CONTACT]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Direct contact card of assigned Licensed Secretary</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Practicing certificate info (MIA / MAICSA license no.)</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr></table>+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
</pre>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">Screen-by-Screen Breakdown:</h3>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">2.1 Home &amp; Dashboard</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:12px;"><li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * The selected company name, registration number, and SSM incorporation date.
  <em> A <strong>Compliance Health Banner</strong> that immediately reassures the director whether their company is in </em>"Good Standing"* or has an overdue obligation.
  <em> <strong>Urgent Action Cards:</strong> Clear notification badges such as </em>"1 File Needs to be Submitted"<em> or </em>"Waiting for Secretary Review"*.
<em> <strong>Why it matters:</strong> Business owners don't have time to read complex legal acts. This screen tells them immediately: </em>"Is my company safe today, or do I need to take action?"*

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">2.2 Compliance Calendar</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * An interactive visual calendar marking Malaysian statutory dates:
    1. <strong>Section 68 Annual Return (AR):</strong> Yearly renewal mandated by SSM.
    2. <strong>Section 248 Financial Statements:</strong> Audited/unaudited accounts circulation.
    3. <strong>Section 58 Notices:</strong> Changes in company officers (directors/secretaries).
    4. <strong>CP204 Statutory Tax Schedule:</strong> Inland Revenue Board (LHDN) tax estimate deadlines.
<em> <strong>Why it matters:</strong> Late filings with SSM result in compound fines starting at RM50 to thousands of ringgit. The calendar gives countdown badges (e.g., </em>"Due in 18 days"*) so deadlines are never missed.

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">2.3 Document Vault &amp; Repository</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * A neat digital filing cabinet divided into four clear folders:
    * <strong>Corporate:</strong> Constitution, Form 9 (Certificate of Incorporation), Section 14 Superform.
    * <strong>Statutory:</strong> Lodged Annual Returns, Section 58 director registers, board resolutions.
    * <strong>Accounting:</strong> Audited accounts, tax computation reports.
    * <strong>Attention Needed:</strong> Documents that the secretary reviewed and requested revisions or re-signatures on.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Directors no longer need to dig through messy email threads or WhatsApp attachments when a bank or auditor requests their corporate records.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">2.4 Statutory Filing Tracker (Transactions)</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * A visual progress tracker for every request submitted to the secretary:
    1. <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">Uploaded</code> $\rightarrow$ Customer sent the file.
    2. <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">In Review</code> $\rightarrow$ Licensed secretary is checking legal validity.
    3. <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">More Info Needed</code> $\rightarrow$ Secretary requested clarification or re-upload.
    4. <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">Certified &amp; Approved</code> $\rightarrow$ Secretary approved the statutory paperwork.
    5. <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">Lodged with SSM</code> $\rightarrow$ Official SSM lodgement complete with reference receipt.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Complete transparency. Clients can track their progress 24/7 without having to call or message the secretary.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">2.5 Secretary Contact &amp; Profile</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  <em> Name and contact information of the assigned licensed company secretary (e.g., </em>Lim Mei Ling - MIA CA 48192*).
  * Direct office phone, registered address, and official firm name.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Gives peace of mind that an authorized, qualified practitioner is handling their company.</li>

<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0; margin:24px 0;"/>

<h2 style="color:#0F172A; font-size:16pt; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:22px;">3. Platform 2: The Secretary Workspace (<code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">mysect_secretary</code>)</h2>
<em>Target User:</em> <strong>Licensed Company Secretaries (MIA, MAICSA, LS) and Corporate Secretarial Firm Staff.</strong>  
<em>Primary Goal:</em> Provide an efficient, error-free operational desk to manage client filings, review incoming files, and maintain practice compliance.

<pre style="background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #E2E8F0; padding:12px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9pt; line-height:1.4;">
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
