ign:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Urgent Action Queue: Highest-priority client documents waiting for vetting</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">[2. CLIENT DOCUMENT REVIEW QUEUE]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Filter by: Pending Review</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Clarification Needed</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Approved</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Rejected</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Document Details View: Document metadata, client remarks, file preview</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Action Bar: [Approve &amp; Certify] or [Request More Details / Clarification]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">[3. CLIENT COMPANIES PORTFOLIO]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• Master table of all assigned businesses</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Health status, paid-up capital, director roster, and next statutory due date</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">[4. STATUTORY FILING &amp; LODGEMENT LOG]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• SSM reference numbers, MBRS lodgement receipts, and submission dates</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">[5. FIRM SUBSCRIPTION &amp; 2FA SECURITY]</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">• Active plan tier (Starter, Growth, Pro, Enterprise) &amp; company quota limits</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">• 6-digit statutory 2-Factor Authentication (2FA) sign-in</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"></td></tr></table>+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
</pre>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">Screen-by-Screen Breakdown:</h3>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">3.1 Operations Dashboard</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * High-level practice counters: Total companies managed, pending document reviews, approved lodgements, and upcoming annual filing deadlines.
  * An <strong>Urgent Queue</strong> highlighting client submissions that need immediate attention.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Company secretaries manage dozens or hundreds of client companies simultaneously. This dashboard acts as their morning briefing, preventing tasks from slipping through the cracks.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">3.2 Client Document Review Queue</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * A dedicated inbox showing all documents uploaded by client directors.
  * Secretary tools:
    * <strong>File Preview:</strong> Direct on-screen document inspection.
    * <strong>Approve &amp; Certify Button:</strong> Marks the document as legally sound and moves the workflow forward.
    <em> <strong>Request More Details Button:</strong> Sends an instant clarification prompt back to the client’s mobile app (e.g., </em>"Please provide signed Director's Circular Resolution"*).
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Eliminates messy email chains. Every review decision, approval, and clarification request is recorded with a clear timestamp.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">3.3 Client Companies Portfolio Tab</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * The complete list of businesses assigned to the firm.
  * Key data points per company: SSM Registration Number, Company Type (Sdn Bhd), Paid-Up Capital, Registered Address, Active Directors, and upcoming statutory filing dates.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Replaces bulky paper physical statutory registers with an instantly searchable, cloud-backed company directory.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">3.4 Statutory Filing &amp; Lodgement Tracker</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * The history of all filings submitted to SSM (Annual Returns, Form 58, Share Allocations).
  * Records the official SSM lodgement transaction number, date filed, and filing officer name.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Provides definitive proof of timely submission in case of an SSM compliance audit.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">3.5 Firm Profile, Subscription &amp; 2FA Security</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * The firm's practicing credentials (e.g., MIA / MAICSA registration).
  <em> Current platform plan tier (</em>Starter, Growth, Professional, Enterprise*) and company quota usage.
  * <strong>2-Factor Authentication (2FA):</strong> 6-digit OTP verification protecting client corporate secrets.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Ensures bank-grade security and statutory data protection in compliance with the Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA).</li>

<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0; margin:24px 0;"/>

<h2 style="color:#0F172A; font-size:16pt; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:22px;">4. Platform 3: The Super Admin Platform Console (<code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">mysect_admin</code>)</h2>
<em>Target User:</em> <strong>MySect HQ Platform Administrators, Operations Heads, and System Auditors.</strong>  
<em>Primary Goal:</em> Maintain overall platform governance, onboard trusted secretarial practices, allocate companies, and ensure legal and regulatory compliance.

