<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">Screen-by-Screen Breakdown:</h3>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.1 Overview Dashboard</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * Live platform vitals: Total active client companies, onboarded secretarial practices, pending firm verifications, and urgent unresolved issues.
  * System operational status and storage telemetry.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Gives MySect HQ executive visibility into how the platform is performing across Malaysia in real time.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.2 Users &amp; Access Control (RBAC)</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * Master user directory categorized by role: Super Admin, Compliance Lead, Licensed Secretary, and Client Director.
  * User security controls:
    * <strong>Status Toggle:</strong> Instantly activate or suspend user accounts if unauthorized behavior is detected.
    * <strong>Reset 2FA:</strong> Dispatches one-time recovery codes to users locked out of their accounts.
    * <strong>Audit History:</strong> Full log of every sign-in, IP address, and role change.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Enforces strict role-based data isolation so unauthorized personnel can never view private company data.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.3 Secretary Firms Governance</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * Onboarding queue for new secretarial firms applying to join the MySect network.
  * <strong>Licence Verification:</strong> Displays practicing certificates (MIA / MAICSA registration numbers) for admin verification.
  <em> <strong>Governance Controls:</strong> 1-click actions to </em>Approve<em>, </em>Suspend<em>, or </em>Reactivate* a partner firm based on compliance standing.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Guarantees that only legally qualified, certified company secretaries are permitted to handle client company affairs.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.4 Companies &amp; Firm Assignment</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * Master catalog of all registered Malaysian companies on the platform.
  * <strong>Assignment Engine:</strong> Assigns each company to an authorized secretary firm.
  * <strong>Inter-Firm Transfer:</strong> If a client switches secretaries, the admin can smoothly transfer the company portfolio to a new firm while logging statutory reasons for the handover.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Prevents orphaned companies and ensures every business has an accountable secretarial team at all times.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.5 Operations &amp; Issues</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  * <strong>Escalations &amp; Overdue:</strong> Automatically flags any filing approaching statutory deadline danger zones.
  * <strong>Support &amp; Disputes:</strong> Facilitates resolution if a client and secretary have an operational dispute.
  * <strong>Announcements &amp; Notices:</strong> Broadcasts urgent statutory notices (e.g., SSM system maintenance or tax deadline extensions) to all platform users.
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Keeps the network running smoothly and proactively prevents late-filing fines.</li>

<h3 style="color:#1E3A8A; font-size:13pt; margin-top:16px;">4.6 Plans &amp; Platform Settings</h3>
<li><strong>What it shows:</strong> </li>
  <em> Subscription plan configurations (</em>Starter, Growth, Professional, Enterprise*).
  * Company quotas per firm (e.g., Professional plan allows up to 250 client companies).
<li><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Powers the commercial and business model of MySect.</li></ul>

<hr style="border:0; border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0; margin:24px 0;"/>

