eft; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"><strong>Check Compliance Health</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Yes (Own company only)</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Yes (All assigned clients)</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Yes (Platform-wide)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"><strong>Upload Documents</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Yes (Direct upload)</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Yes (Drafts &amp; resolutions)</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">No (Privacy isolated)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"><strong>Review &amp; Approve Documents</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Approves drafted paperwork</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Vets &amp; certifies client files</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">No (Legal boundary)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"><strong>File with SSM</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Initiates request</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Prepares &amp; lodges filing</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Monitors completion</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"><strong>Onboard New Secretary Firms</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">No</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">No</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Yes (Reviews credentials)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;"><strong>Assign Companies to Firms</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">No</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">No</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#FFFFFF;">Yes (Full assignment engine)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;"><strong>Security &amp; Authentication</strong></td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">Email &amp; Password</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;">2FA Statutory Code</td><td style="border:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; font-size:10pt; background-color:#F8FAFC;