<h2 style="color:#0F172A; font-size:16pt; border-bottom:1px solid #CBD5E1; padding-bottom:4px; margin-top:22px;">6. Three-Minute Presentation Script (Presenter Cheatsheet)</h2>

Use this script during your demo or slide presentation:

&gt; <strong>[Slide 1 — The Problem &amp; Solution]</strong>  
&gt; <em>"Good morning everyone. Managing corporate secretarial compliance in Malaysia has traditionally been messy—chasing missing documents over WhatsApp, lost paper files, and surprise SSM compound penalties. MySect changes that by connecting Directors, licensed Secretaries, and Platform Administrators on one unified system."</em>

&gt; <strong>[Slide 2 — The Client Mobile App]</strong>  
&gt; <em>"First, for business owners, we have the <strong>MySect Mobile App</strong>. In just 5 seconds, a director can open the app, see their compliance health score, view an interactive calendar counting down their next Annual Return deadline, and upload documents securely. No legal jargon—just clear status updates from upload to official SSM lodgement."</em>

&gt; <strong>[Slide 3 — The Secretary Workspace]</strong>  
&gt; <em>"Second, for licensed company secretaries, we built the <strong>Secretary Workspace</strong>. Running smoothly on web and mobile browsers, it gives secretaries a centralized inbox of incoming client documents. With one click, they can approve paperwork or request clarification. They can also manage their entire company portfolio, track filing reference numbers, and log in securely with 2-Factor Authentication."</em>

&gt; <strong>[Slide 4 — The Super Admin Console]</strong>  
&gt; <em>"Finally, overseeing everything is the <strong>Super Admin Console</strong>. This is MySect HQ's governance hub. Admins verify practicing certificates to ensure only qualified secretaries join, allocate companies between firms, control user permissions, and monitor overdue escalations across the entire country with an immutable audit trail."</em>

&gt; <strong>[Slide 5 — Conclusion &amp; Release Status]</strong>  
&gt; <em>"All three products are feature-complete, deployed live on <code style="background:#F1F5F9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, monospace; font-size:9.5pt; color:#0F172A;">mysect.my</code>, and fully responsive across both mobile and desktop screens. MySect delivers transparency for directors, efficiency for secretaries, and governance for platform operators. Thank you!"</em>

